CAT(1)

NAME
     cat - print files

SYNOPSIS
     cat [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
     Prints each file on the screen, one after another. With no file,
     prints whatever is piped into it.

     Good for short files. For long ones, use more, head or tail.

EXAMPLES
     cat ledger
     cat /etc/motd

SEE ALSO
     more(1), head(1), tail(1)
